WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:08.600
A great game recap takes time — and right after the final whistle, that's the last thing a coach has.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.800
So Kinectem built AI Assist right into the recap composer.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:23.300
Just jot down what happened. A few rough notes is all it takes.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:33.300
AI Assist turns them into a polished, ready-to-share recap — in seconds.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:39.800
Insert it, tweak anything you like, and hit post.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:48.300
Your players — and their families — get a recap worth remembering.